<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-TRANSVAAL 263-8 AT TEA VS W.PROVINCE.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-TRANSVAAL 263-8 AT TEA VS W.PROVINCE.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Transvaal were 263 for eight at tea on the third day of the Supersport Series match against Western Province at the Wanderers.</p>
<p>Scores: Transvaal 371 and 263-8 (Ken Rutherford 126 not out), Western Province 227.</p>
